{"suttaId":"thi-ap11","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-iii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[6939,7000],"vripara":"1"},"segments":{"thi-ap11:0.3":"Ekūposathikātherīapadānaṃ","thi-ap11:1.1":"“Nagare bandhumatiyā, bandhumā nāma khattiyo;","thi-ap11:1.3":"Divase puṇṇamāya so, upavasi uposathaṃ.","thi-ap11:2.1":"“Ahaṃ tena samayena, kumbhadāsī ahaṃ tahiṃ;","thi-ap11:2.3":"Disvā sarājakaṃ senaṃ, evāhaṃ cintayiṃ tadā.","thi-ap11:3.1":"‘Rājāpi rajjaṃ chaḍḍetvā, upavasi uposathaṃ;","thi-ap11:3.3":"Saphalaṃ nūna taṃ kammaṃ, janakāyo pamodito’.","thi-ap11:4.1":"“Yoniso paccavekkhitvā, duggaccañca [duggatiñca (syā.)] daliddataṃ [daḷiddataṃ (sī.)];","thi-ap11:4.3":"Mānasaṃ sampahaṃsitvā, upavasiṃ uposathaṃ.","thi-ap11:5.1":"“Ahaṃ uposathaṃ katvā, sammāsambuddhasāsane;","thi-ap11:5.3":"Tena kammena sukatena, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","thi-ap11:6.1":"“Tattha me sukataṃ byamhaṃ, ubbhayojanamuggataṃ [uddhaṃ yojanamuggataṃ (sī. syā. pī.)];","thi-ap11:6.3":"Kūṭāgāravarūpetaṃ, mahāsanasubhūsitaṃ.","thi-ap11:7.1":"“Accharā satasahassā, upatiṭṭhanti maṃ sadā;","thi-ap11:7.3":"Aññe deve atikkamma, atirocāmi sabbadā.","thi-ap11:8.1":"“Catusaṭṭhi devarājūnaṃ, mahesittamakārayiṃ;","thi-ap11:8.3":"Tesaṭṭhi cakkavattīnaṃ, mahesittamakārayiṃ.","thi-ap11:9.1":"“Suvaṇṇavaṇṇā hutvāna, bhavesu saṃsarāmahaṃ;","thi-ap11:9.3":"Sabbattha pavarā homi, uposathassidaṃ phalaṃ.","thi-ap11:10.1":"“Hatthiyānaṃ assayānaṃ, rathayānañca sīvikaṃ [kevalaṃ (sī. syā. pī.)];","thi-ap11:10.3":"Labhāmi sabbamevetaṃ, uposathassidaṃ phalaṃ.","thi-ap11:11.1":"“Soṇṇamayaṃ rūpimayaṃ, athopi phalikāmayaṃ;","thi-ap11:11.3":"Lohitaṅgamayañceva, sabbaṃ paṭilabhāmahaṃ.","thi-ap11:12.1":"“Koseyyakambaliyāni, khomakappāsikāni ca;","thi-ap11:12.3":"Mahagghāni ca vatthāni, sabbaṃ paṭilabhāmahaṃ.","thi-ap11:13.1":"“Annaṃ pānaṃ khādanīyaṃ, vatthasenāsanāni ca;","thi-ap11:13.3":"Sabbametaṃ paṭilabhe, uposathassidaṃ phalaṃ.","thi-ap11:14.1":"“Varagandhañca mālañca, cuṇṇakañca vilepanaṃ;","thi-ap11:14.3":"Sabbametaṃ paṭilabhe, uposathassidaṃ phalaṃ.","thi-ap11:15.1":"“Kūṭāgārañca pāsādaṃ, maṇḍapaṃ hammiyaṃ guhaṃ;","thi-ap11:15.3":"Sabbametaṃ paṭilabhe, uposathassidaṃ phalaṃ.","thi-ap11:16.1":"“Jātiyā sattavassāhaṃ, pabbajiṃ anagāriyaṃ;","thi-ap11:16.3":"Aḍḍhamāse asampatte, arahattamapāpuṇiṃ.","thi-ap11:17.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ, bhavā sabbe samūhatā;","thi-ap11:17.3":"Sabbāsavaparikkhīṇā, natthi dāni punabbhavo.","thi-ap11:18.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe, yaṃ kammamakariṃ tadā;","thi-ap11:18.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, uposathassidaṃ phalaṃ.","thi-ap11:19.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavā.","thi-ap11:20.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","thi-ap11:21.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","thi-ap11:22.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ ekūposathikā bhikkhunī imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","thi-ap11:23.1":"Ekūposathikātheriyāpadānaṃ paṭhamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
